<title>JAPAN: Kokusai Sec to forgive Y5 bln worth of unit's loan.</title>
<headline>Kokusai Sec to forgive Y5 bln worth of unit's loan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kokusai Securities Co Ltd said on Monday it will forgive about five billion yen worth of loans which it has extended to its finance unit and provide about 1.3 billion yen to support the unit in the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
